@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam roundcorner 12
left to right direction
title Implementation status — distinguish source, availability and evidence
rectangle "Implemented source baseline\nAdmin/user workspaces and owned resumes\nPrivate files and public access gates\nPDFs, statistics, appearance and editor features\nProject rename" as Implemented #DCFCE7
rectangle "Declared automated checks\nEvidence for tested cases and checked commits\nNot proof of every behavior or environment" as Checks #DBEAFE
rectangle "Source present, availability conditional\nRegistration code: public routes disabled\nMail/queue configuration: operation not established" as Conditional #FEF3C7
rectangle "Evidence not established by documentation\nProduction restore drill or load benchmark\nComplete accessibility audit\nMalware scanning or monitoring integration\nPrivacy compliance certification" as Pending #FEE2E2
rectangle "Implementation guide\nEntry points and source references" as Guide
rectangle "Backlog and owner decisions\nDefine scope, criteria and required evidence" as Backlog
Implemented --> Guide : locate source
Implemented ..> Checks : tested subset
Conditional --> Backlog : decide availability and verify operation
Pending --> Backlog : plan relevant verification
note bottom of Checks
 Source existence, enabled behavior and verified operation
 are separate questions. These groups are not progress
 percentages or a blanket production-readiness score.
end note
@enduml